[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4745.75, "timestamp": "01:19:05", "text": "君は伐採できる。君は水ができる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4749.51, "timestamp": "01:19:09", "text": "待って。あぁ、くそ。待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4753.189, "timestamp": "01:19:13", "text": "水やりができるゴルキンと一緒に行けると思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4757.669, "timestamp": "01:19:17", "text": "ゴキンが一人いれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4764.229, "timestamp": "01:19:24", "text": "彼も。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4777.75, "timestamp": "01:19:37", "text": "、誰かがこれをやる。誰かがそれを尋ねた"}]